Package: FastWilcoxTest
Type: Package
Title: Fast Wilcoxon Rank-Sum Tests on Sparse Matrices
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Stefan", family = "Lang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "Stefan.Lang@med.lu.se"),
    person(given = "Jitao David", family = "Zhang", role = "ctb", email = "jitao_david.zhang@roche.com")
    )
Description: Fast Wilcoxon rank-sum tests for sparse single-cell expression
    matrices. The main StatTest function operates directly on compressed sparse
    column matrices and performs expression-frequency and fold-change filtering
    before testing. The 0.3 series modernizes the original implementation for
    current R and Matrix stacks while preserving the historical public Wilcoxon
    API and fold-change convention.
